OL,3,AFour workers dead after being hit by
OL,4,Atrain in Japan
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour workers in Japan have died after
OL,7,Fbeing struck by a train at Shin-Kanuma
OL,8,FStation, north of Tokyo, authorities
OL,9,Fsay.
OL,11,FThe collision happened around 10:46
OL,12,Flocal time (01:46 GMT) while the
OL,13,Fworkers were spraying herbicide, said
OL,14,Fthe Tobu Railway, the operator of the
OL,15,Fline.
OL,17,FWhen emergency services arrived at the
OL,18,Fscene three workers were trapped under
OL,19,Fthe train, while one was on the
OL,20,Fplatform, police said.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
